{
  "key": 14692,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GiovanniIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Fwahahaha!\n",
        "Welcome to my hideout!\r",
        "It shall be so until I can restore\n",
        "Team Rocket to its former glory.\r",
        "But, you have found me again.\n",
        "So be it.\f",
        "This time, I’m not holding back!\r",
        "Once more, you shall face\n",
        "Giovanni, the greatest Trainer!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GiovanniPostBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "Having lost in this fashion, \n",
        "I can’t face my followers.\f",
        "I have betrayed their trust.\r",
        "As of today, Team Rocket is\n",
        "finished forever!\r",
        "As for myself, I shall dedicate\n",
        "my life to training again.\r",
        "Let us meet again someday!\n",
        "Farewell!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyAdvice",
      "en_US": [
        "Yo!\n",
        "Champ in the making!\r",
        "Even I don’t know the Viridian\n",
        "Leader’s identity.\r",
        "But one thing’s certain.\n",
        "This will be the toughest of all\f",
        "the Gym Leaders.\r",
        "Also, I heard that the Trainers\n",
        "here like Ground-type Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_GymAides_Text_ViridianCity",
      "en_US": [
        "Prof. Oak’s Aide here!\n",
        "Giovanni’s floor is covered in\f",
        "spin tiles!\r",
        "Step on one and you slide until\n",
        "something stops you. Spinners decide\f",
        "where challengers end up.\r",
        "Mix them with Stop Tiles and you\n",
        "control every step they take!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_DadStory_Text_ArcherIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Archer: …So you’re the one. The kid who\n",
        "beat the Boss. More than once.\r",
        "I’m Archer. I was one of Team Rocket’s\n",
        "executives. When Giovanni was away, I\f",
        "ran things.\r",
        "When he vanished, Team Rocket fell\n",
        "apart. Some of us are still out there,\f",
        "waiting for him to come back.\r",
        "Not me. I turned myself in to the League.\r",
        "They made me an offer. Viridian needed\n",
        "a Leader, and the Boss’s Pokémon needed\f",
        "a Trainer.\r",
        "I’m on probation. One step out of line\n",
        "and the League takes the Gym, and the\f",
        "Pokémon with it.\r",
        "And the ones still loyal to Giovanni call\n",
        "me a traitor. Maybe they’re right."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue",
      "en_US": [
        "Viridian Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: ?\r",
        "Winning Trainers:\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_DadStory_Text_GiovanniRematch",
      "en_US": [
        "Giovanni: Back again?\r",
        "Then face the power your father gave\n",
        "me!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_ViridianCity_Gym_Text_ExplainEarthBadgeTakeThis",
      "en_US": [
        "The Earthbadge makes Pokémon of\n",
        "any level obey without question.\r",
        "It is evidence of your mastery as\n",
        "a Pokémon Trainer.\r",
        "With it, you can challenge the\n",
        "Pokémon League.\r",
        "Also, take this TM.\r",
        "Consider it a gift for your Pokémon\n",
        "League challenge."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_ViridianCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedTM26FromGiovanni",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} received TM26\n",
        "from Giovanni."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_ViridianCity_Gym_Text_ExplainTM26",
      "en_US": [
        "TM26 contains Earthquake.\r",
        "It is a powerful attack that causes\n",
        "a massive tremor.\r",
        "I made it when I ran the Gym here,\n",
        "far too long ago… "
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_GymHack_Text_GiovanniSilverCap",
      "en_US": [
        "Giovanni: The League insists every\n",
        "Gym Leader hands these out."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_GymHack_Text_GiovanniSilverCapAfter",
      "en_US": [
        "Spend it on a Pokémon that has\n",
        "earned it.\r",
        "Strength is an investment.\n",
        "Never waste it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyPostVictory",
      "en_US": [
        "Blow me away! Giovanni was the\n",
        "Gym Leader of Viridian?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_GymAides_Text_ViridianCityAfter",
      "en_US": [
        "With the Earth Badge, your Gym PC\n",
        "sells Spin Tiles and Stop Tiles.\r",
        "Build a spinning maze… and test it\n",
        "yourself. A Gym nobody can finish\f",
        "isn’t much fun!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_DadStory_Text_ArcherOwedDad",
      "en_US": [
        "Archer: I owe your father more than I\n",
        "can ever pay back.\r",
        "I was just a Grunt who was good with\n",
        "machines. He’s the one who brought me\f",
        "into the labs. He taught me everything I\f",
        "know.\r",
        "The night he walked out on the Boss, I\n",
        "was the one guarding the door. I had\f",
        "orders to stop him.\r",
        "I looked the other way. It’s the only\n",
        "good thing I ever did in Team Rocket.\r",
        "The Boss never found out it was me. He\n",
        "just had your father’s lab cleared out.\f",
        "Every note. Every prototype.\r",
        "One of them was a crystal.\r",
        "Your father found that it could make a\n",
        "Pokémon shine like a gem and take on a\f",
        "new type. He called it\f",
        "Terastallization.\r",
        "He never got to finish it. The Boss\n",
        "ordered me to.\r",
        "I told myself I was protecting his work.\n",
        "That if I finished it, nobody worse would\f",
        "get the chance.\r",
        "I don’t know if that’s true. But it took\n",
        "me years, and this is the only one that\f",
        "works."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_DadStory_Text_ArcherGiveOrb",
      "en_US": [
        "Archer: It was always his. It’s yours\n",
        "now."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_DadStory_Text_ArcherTeraRules",
      "en_US": [
        "Archer: Hold it up in battle and one of\n",
        "your Pokémon will Terastallize. One a\f",
        "battle. It never runs out.\r",
        "The League has rules about it, of\n",
        "course. In Gym battles, League battles\f",
        "and against your rival, a Gym Leader’s\f",
        "Pokémon can only Terastallize into the\f",
        "Gym’s type.\r",
        "Anywhere else, a Pokémon can use its own\n",
        "Tera Type, but only if it’s a type you’ve\f",
        "mastered. Until then, it’s your Gym’s\f",
        "type everywhere.\r",
        "Once you’ve mastered a type, come and\n",
        "see me. I can tune your Pokémon’s Tera\f",
        "Types. It takes berries of the type:\f",
        "three a time.\r",
        "And {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}… the strongest Trainers\n",
        "know how to use it too. Be ready."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_DadStory_Text_ArcherAskForgiveness",
      "en_US": [
        "Archer: I know I don’t have the right to\n",
        "ask. But…\r",
        "Can you forgive me?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_DadStory_Text_ArcherForgiven",
      "en_US": [
        "Archer: …Thank you.\r",
        "I’ll make this a Gym your father would\n",
        "have respected."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GymStatuePlayerWon",
      "en_US": [
        "Viridian Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Giovanni\r",
        "Winning Trainers:\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_DadStory_Text_GiovanniYouLost",
      "en_US": [
        "Giovanni: Ha. Looks like I was right.\r",
        "Now get out of here, kid."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_DadStory_Text_GiovanniTakeThese",
      "en_US": [
        "Giovanni: You’re just like your father.\r",
        "Take these."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_DadStory_Text_ReceivedEarthBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} received the Earthbadge from\n",
        "Giovanni!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_ViridianCity_Gym_Text_YouDoNotHaveSpace",
      "en_US": "You do not have space for this!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_GymHack_Text_GiftSentToPC",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Bag is full, so the\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} was sent to your PC."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_DadStory_Text_ArcherSomethingElse",
      "en_US": [
        "Archer: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}. Wait.\r",
        "There’s something I didn’t tell you last\n",
        "time."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_DadStory_Text_ArcherTuneOffer",
      "en_US": [
        "Archer: Want me to tune one of your\n",
        "Pokémon’s Tera Types?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_DadStory_Text_ArcherTunePick",
      "en_US": [
        "Archer: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s Tera Type is\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}. Which type should it be?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_DadStory_Text_ArcherTunePrice",
      "en_US": [
        "Archer: The crystal needs something of\n",
        "the type to take it in. For {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0},\f",
        "that’s {STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0}. Go ahead?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_DadStory_Text_ArcherTuned",
      "en_US": [
        "Archer: Done. Outside League battles,\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} will Terastallize into the\f",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} type.\r",
        "In a League battle, it’s still your Gym’s\n",
        "type. Those are the rules."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_DadStory_Text_ArcherAgain",
      "en_US": [
        "Archer: The Boss’s Pokémon answer to me\n",
        "now. I’ll make this a Gym your father\f",
        "would have respected."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_DadStory_Text_ArcherNotForgiven",
      "en_US": [
        "Archer: …I understand.\r",
        "Then I’ll earn it. However long it takes."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_DadStory_Text_GiovanniHow",
      "en_US": [
        "Giovanni: How?! Did you… did you use\n",
        "your father’s inventions?\r",
        "He beat me in the end too. Not at first.\r",
        "He tried and tried and tried to do it\n",
        "without help, but eventually he\f",
        "succumbed to the allure of strength and\f",
        "power.\r",
        "He came back, one last time, with a team\n",
        "full of his creations.\r",
        "The strongest Pokémon I have ever\n",
        "seen…\r",
        "I wasn’t even angry; I was in awe.\r",
        "And I was sure I could convince him to\n",
        "come back to help Team Rocket.\r",
        "And just when I thought I’d worn him\n",
        "down, that’s when it happened.\r",
        "His {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got angry, or scared, or\n",
        "confused, or something. Not that it\f",
        "matters.\r",
        "It attacked your father. And he didn’t\n",
        "stand a chance.\r",
        "But that doesn’t matter to me.\r",
        "He beat me once and Team Rocket\n",
        "survived. His kid beating me is no\f",
        "different.\r",
        "Now get out of my…"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_DadStory_Text_MomLastTime",
      "en_US": [
        "Mom: This is the last time you hurt my\n",
        "family, Giovanni.\r",
        "The last time!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_DadStory_Text_ChanseyGlows",
      "en_US": [
        "Chansey let out a cry that shook the\n",
        "whole Gym.\r",
        "It began to glow, brighter and\n",
        "brighter, with all the power Dad\f",
        "had built into it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_DadStory_Text_ChanseyUnleashes",
      "en_US": [
        "Chansey unleashed it all at once, in a\n",
        "blinding beam of light aimed straight\f",
        "at Giovanni!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_DadStory_Text_GiovanniOverwhelmed",
      "en_US": [
        "Giovanni: Wh-what is this…?!\r",
        "This power… it’s… too much…!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_DadStory_Text_GiovanniGone",
      "en_US": [
        "When the light faded, Giovanni was\n",
        "gone.\r",
        "The boss of Team Rocket had been\n",
        "overwhelmed by the very power Dad\f",
        "created."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_DadStory_Text_MomDadsChansey",
      "en_US": [
        "Mom: He created this Pokémon. This\n",
        "Chansey.\r",
        "After you were born… you inspired him.\r",
        "It was an attempt to heal all the damage\n",
        "he had done.\r",
        "It’s strong, like the others, but it\n",
        "derives its strength from something not\f",
        "evil.\r",
        "It’s a partner, a true friend.\r",
        "He gave it to me when he got… swept up in\n",
        "all this.\r",
        "And I’ve kept it all these years as a way\n",
        "to remember him.\r",
        "Those last few months, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}, he was\n",
        "in shambles about what he’d done.\r",
        "You were born and it gave him a new\n",
        "perspective.\r",
        "He tried to make up for the years of pain\n",
        "he caused. And, in a way, he succeeded.\r",
        "He succeeded with you.\r",
        "What you did today, to finish the work\n",
        "that he started… he would have been so\f",
        "proud.\r",
        "Take this Chansey. It’s yours now.\n",
        "That’s what he would have wanted.\r",
        "Go battle the Elite Four. Win your Gym."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_DadStory_Text_ReceivedDadsChansey",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} received Dad’s Chansey!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_DadStory_Text_ReceivedDadsNotebook",
      "en_US": [
        "She handed you something.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} received Dad’s Notebook!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_DadStory_Text_MomConfession",
      "en_US": [
        "Mom: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}… there’s something I need\n",
        "to tell you.\r",
        "I knew your father worked with\n",
        "Giovanni. I knew Team Rocket came to\f",
        "our door at all hours.\r",
        "But I never knew how deep it went. Not\n",
        "until today.\r",
        "He never told me, and I never asked. I\n",
        "think I was afraid of the answer.\r",
        "What I did know is that, at the end, he\n",
        "was trying to make it right.\r",
        "This Chansey. The switch in his lab that\n",
        "makes his machines gentle. That was him\f",
        "making amends.\r",
        "I hid that switch after he died. I\n",
        "couldn’t bear to look at it. It’s back\f",
        "where it belongs now.\r",
        "I should have told you all of this a long\n",
        "time ago. I’m sorry.\r",
        "Come on. Let’s go home. Prof. Oak wants\n",
        "to see you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_DadStory_Text_GiovanniYourFather",
      "en_US": [
        "Giovanni: He tried to stop me too, you\n",
        "know.\r",
        "He did well. He took down much of the\n",
        "organization I built from within.\r",
        "But he paid the price.\r",
        "Do you know what he did, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}? All\n",
        "the evil things he contributed to Team\f",
        "Rocket?\r",
        "Ha. I bet you don’t know the first thing\n",
        "about him.\r",
        "He was my top deputy. My best scientist.\n",
        "His inventions gave us unfathomable\f",
        "power!\r",
        "It was a shame when he defied me.\r",
        "Something about a “conscience,”\n",
        "treating Pokémon with “kindness” and\f",
        "not as a means for power.\r",
        "Blah, blah, blah. I shut him up, though.\n",
        "Used his own inventions against him.\r",
        "I tried to play nice with you. You’re his\n",
        "child, after all.\r",
        "And he was such a good deputy, even if\n",
        "he was a little… soft.\r",
        "But I’m done playing nice.\r",
        "I’ll show you my true power… the power\n",
        "your father gave me!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_rock",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! You made it!\r",
        "Your Rock types have gotten solid\n",
        "since Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Two Rock Gyms in Kanto?\n",
        "I can’t wait!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_normal",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: Good to see you again,\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!\r",
        "Your Normal types fought well.\n",
        "Basics win battles. Stick with it!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_water",
      "en_US": [
        "Misty: Hmph. So the kid from\n",
        "Oak’s lab made it all the way here.\r",
        "Your Water Pokémon are good.\n",
        "Annoyingly good.\r",
        "There’s still only room for One\n",
        "Water Gym in Kanto!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_electric",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: Well, well! The Electric\n",
        "kid from Oak’s lab!\r",
        "You’ve got a spark, I’ll give you\n",
        "that. But this is still my turf!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_steel",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: The Steel kid from\n",
        "Oak’s lab! Your team held up under\f",
        "fire.\r",
        "Still don’t buy a Steel Gym in\n",
        "Pallet, though!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_grass",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: Oh, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! It’s so nice\n",
        "to see you again.\r",
        "Your Grass Pokémon have grown so\n",
        "much since we met at Oak’s lab."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_poison",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: …So. The child from Oak’s\n",
        "lab grows stronger.\r",
        "I have watched you. I still will\n",
        "not make it easy for a rival."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_bug",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: Fwahaha! You’ve come far\n",
        "since Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Your Bug Pokémon surprised even\n",
        "me. A little."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_psychic",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: …As I foresaw at Oak’s\n",
        "lab, you came.\r",
        "I still do not like a second\n",
        "Psychic Gym. But visions do not\f",
        "ask for permission."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_fairy",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: We meet again, as I said\n",
        "we would.\r",
        "Your Fairy Pokémon trust you\n",
        "completely. That is rare."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_fire",
      "en_US": [
        "Blaine: Hah! My favorite Fire\n",
        "trainer! Quiz! Who knew you’d make\f",
        "it this far?\r",
        "Answer: me! Wahahahah!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_ground",
      "en_US": [
        "Bruno: Hoo hah! {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! Your\n",
        "Ground Pokémon have grown sturdy!\r",
        "Now show me the power of the\n",
        "earth itself!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_dark",
      "en_US": [
        "Agatha: Well, if it isn’t Oak’s\n",
        "Dark whippersnapper.\r",
        "You got this far? Hah! Let’s see\n",
        "what my gifts did for you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_ice",
      "en_US": [
        "Lorelei: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}. I’ve waited for\n",
        "this since Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Show me how cold you’ve become!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_fighting",
      "en_US": [
        "Bruno: Hoo hah! {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! You’ve\n",
        "grown strong since Oak’s lab!\r",
        "Now let our Pokémon talk with\n",
        "their fists!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0454_T02GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_ghost",
      "en_US": [
        "Agatha: Well, if it isn’t Oak’s\n",
        "Ghost whippersnapper.\r",
        "You got this far? Hah! Let’s see\n",
        "what my gifts did for you!"
      ]
